Package: MicroplasticDataProcessor
Title: FTIR, Raman and LDIR Microplastic Particle Data Processor
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Kristof", "Moeller",
           email = "kristof-moeller@t-online.de",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shiny application that ingests per-particle microplastic
    identification exports from FTIR, Raman, and LDIR microspectroscopy
    instruments, auto-detects the instrument from the file's column
    signature, standardizes free-text polymer names to a canonical set of
    abbreviations, bins particles by size class, and writes a formatted
    multi-sheet Excel workbook (per-file breakdowns, totals, summary
    statistics, and a material name-mapping audit trail) for one file or a
    whole folder at a time.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
